# Two review FINDINGS on src/layout.rs, for examples/page-preview.rs (ledger #458).
#
# A finding is RDF, so the preview loads this graph straight into its store and
# needs no model call. It was produced by a real review pass over this checkout
# with a stub model standing in, then one finding was declined, and the store was
# dumped: the major one is PENDING (its card shows both severity badges and the
# publish/decline form), the minor one is DECLINED with a reason (its card shows
# the record and the revise forms). The review pass record is kept because a
# pending finding must be in the standing set of its file's current pass, or it
# reads as superseded.
#
# The content hash and offsets are this file's as it stood then. The drift pass
# re-anchors both quotes against the file as it stands now; a quote that is gone
# renders flagged as orphaned. tests/preview_fixture.rs loads this graph and
# checks both cards still render, so a change to the record format reddens a test
# rather than silently emptying the preview.

